b0 view of the eighty-eight constellations of the Milky Way\n-The \"moments of history\" section shows the process of human cognition of the universe in the form of animation.", "short_description": "Experience the space in VR! Space Says 2 is a stunning model of space that shows you something full of magnificent. You can walk through the solar system to watch our earth, learn the knowledge. You can also see some astrophysical phenomena in front of you and even control them."}]}, "developer_name": "Chesstar Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://chesstar.com/p/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Chesstar Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.chesstar.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6925349440840480"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 7, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2095234867288416"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "295028471531742"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "161023931903864"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "649987235597881"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2433311746780699"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "265657454747044"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "258122361862563"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2433311746780699"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1588611600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2095234867288416"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typena